                <pb facs="0109" n="103" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg103"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Denby to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 102.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-02-19"><hi rendition="#italic">February 19,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I sent yesterday a telegram to Japan stating that Li Hung-chang had been named
                    plenipotentiary. His honors were restored to-day. He will hand over his duties
                    as viceroy. He will be here the 21st instant. Japan was asked to name a place of
                    meeting of plenipotentiaries. His credentials will be full powers to conclude
                    and to sign peace treaty.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
